---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import BgpLab from '../../components/BgpLab';
import BgpSession from '../../components/BgpSession';
---
<Base title="BGP Lab" description="Interactive BGP simulator: change LOCAL_PREF, prepending and MED, cut links, and watch best-path selection decide.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">BGP lab</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-muted">
      Four routes lead to the same destination. Change their attributes, cut links, and see which path BGP picks and
      exactly which rule decided it. Complete the missions to learn the order of the rules.
    </p>
    <BgpLab client:load />
    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Why won't my session come up?</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-muted">Step through a healthy BGP session, then break it in the three most common ways.</p>
    <BgpSession client:visible />
    <p class="text-sm text-muted">Full explanations are in <a class="text-accent underline" href="/learn/routing/01-bgp-fundamentals">BGP fundamentals</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
